abstract: >-
  Desktop application for battery researchers: reads LAND .cex and Neware .ndax
  raw files and produces voltage profiles, cycling metrics, voltage-time and
  dQ/dV figures for presentations and papers, with Excel export of the plotted data.
keywords:
